illa (31-55)(Camping) = valmis skilli, levelilla (20-40)(Fire Building) = valmis skilli, levelilla (40-50)Tossa nyt ois jotain,.**Celtron**Subj: protremoveDate: Oct 23sen spellin pitää sitten ottaa ihan kaikki pois päältä, myös stun resistimyös vulnit pitää lähtee pois (niitä voi sitten olla enemmän kuin yksi!).toi on ihan toimiva ratkaisu, itse olin ajatellut tehdä sen hieman erilailla, mutta eipä tuossasen kummempaa.haluan että kokeilet vielä, että se tosiaankin ottaa kaikki enchantment spellit pois jostain ukosta.parempi korjata se ennen peliin pistämistä kuin vasta sen jälkeen.PS. kirjoita spellille vielä spelldescikin.**Ntg**Subj: EQ:tDate: Nov 28Black ring with yellow stones on it X2White turbanShining white robesBoots of light**Jenny**Subj: SpellejäDate: Mar 12merchanteile olis hyvä saada sellanen spelli millä näkis % lukeman paljon mosulla on Hpta jäljellä, helpottas arviointii onko mosa tapettavis etc, sit Abjut vois saada sellasen millä näkis mitä protteja targetissa on...ihan kätevä sekin equtuksessa ei tarviis arvailla mitä on viel pääl ja mitä ei...sit joku haste ois iha kiva mageille mikä nostas pikkasen hp ja sp ja ep regeneitä tjsp...muissakin mudeis käsittääkseni jotain tollasia...sit siihen poisoniin, Poison sana ois hyvä jos sen vois clerutki sit oppia ja sitä sanaa hyödyntäen castaa poison removee ja abjuile sama kans ne vois pistää pientä resistii poisonii vastaa et pystyt savee poisonaamisen ettei se tuliskaan...sit se boltti ja strm vois olla niiku normi boltitki on mut sit sillä pystys castaa Cre lopputavul esim sen \"poison\" jutun et tippus sitä hpta sillee välil pikkase...mut vain 1 poison vois olla kerral pääl ettei sitä vois chainaa iha tajuttomia**Rimber**Subj: BUgiDate: Mar 26You take a pile of gray bones from the ground.You start fleeing from the battle.A promontory reaching over a frozen pond (w,cave)An adult polar bear is looking after its offspringA baby polar bear is playing around in hereA baby polar bear is playing around in hereA huge underground opening (n,s,e)A baby polar bear is playing around in hereA baby polar bear is playing around in hereOn a frozen pond (n,s,w,e,nw,ne)An ice golemYou start slippering onwards on the icy surface.On a frozen pond (n,s,w,e,sw,se)An ice golemYou start slippering onwards on the icy surface.A snowy shore of a frozen pond (s,e,se,enter)A growling guard dog, chained to an iglooA spacious igloo made of frozen snow (out)Gordon, the banished snow Dwarf                              You give A pile of gray bones to Gordon.Gordon says: 'Absolutely brilliant thinking, my friend! I will go light              these right ahead. You can join with me if you like. Meet              me at the campfire just outside my igloo.Gordon arrives from enter.The icy pond ends into a small strip of snowy land. From north and westthe strip is bordered with sturdy and frozen-looking snowy walls. Theceiling, where can be seen some icicles, is pitched towards the frozenwall in north. By the northern wall, almost touching the ceiling, canbe seen an igloo. The doorway is blocked with a planket, but the igloocan still be entered without any troubles. Near the doorway seems to bea small campfire.    There are four obvious exits: south, east, southeast and enterGordon, the banished snow DwarfGordon places all bones in a nice pile inside the circle of icy rocks.Gordon smiles as he looks at his work of art.Gordon starts skillfully rub two of the bones against each other.Very thin smoke starts rising from the two bones.Gordon manages to light a small fire with the bones.Gordon seems very confident as the flames in the campfire start to grow.Gordon says: 'Ah, I did it! I think I just sit here for a moment and watch the $You take a brass tea pan.A dark igloo made of frozen snow (out)Dooris, the banished snow Dwarf femaleDooris says dreamily: 'I think I'm in love with my neighbor, Gordon.'You give A brass tea pan to Dooris.Dooris says: 'How wonderful! Wait a moment while I drink this.'Dooris takes a tiny gulp of tea and smiles dreamily.Looks like Dooris would be in heaven when drinking from the pan.Dooris tips the tea pan and takes a short peek inside of it.A wonderful scent spreads in the igloo from the open tea pan.Dooris tips the tea pan and takes a short peek inside of it.Dooris takes a tiny gulp of tea and smiles dreamily.Looks like Dooris would be in heaven when drinking from the pan.Dooris licks her lips while not drinking the tea.Dooris says: 'Oh, that was maybe the best tea moment in my life.'Dooris says: 'Now let's return this tea pan back to its original place.              I'll follow you for that time.A snowy shore of a frozen pond (s,w,sw,enter)Dooris arrives after Rimber.A snowy shore of a frozen pond (s,e,se,enter)Gordon, the banished snow DwarfDooris arrives after Rimber.Dooris hangs the tea pan back to its original place above the fireplace.Gordon looks at Dooris.Dooris says: 'I don't know actually why, but I think I'll stay here for a while.Dooris smiles mysteriously at Gordon.Gordon winks meaningfully at Dooris.Dooris whispers something to Gordon.Gordon giggles inanely.Gordon whispers something to Dooris.Dooris blushes in bright red.Gordon pulls Dooris in his arms and gives her a long, passionate kiss.Dooris stares dreamingly at Gordon.Gordon winks behind his shoulders.Gordon leaves in enter.Your sensitive mind notices a wrongness in the fabric of space.**Ozmolokki**Subj: NECROTDate: Apr 25Necrojen bugit kämmit yms.horde ei tee ollenkaan melee damaa. vain outrageous powerilla ja jos hordesta kuoleemosa niin lichi muistaa castata yhden boltin muuten horde ei sitten damagea teekkäänhorde ei pääse cityyn ellei tapa niitä guardeja gateiltahorde ei tule banditeille vaan menee jonnekkin perseeseen eli banditeista pitäis selvitä yksin.yleistä on että horde häviää jos tulee banditti vastaanench